    "description": "TECHNOLOGIES, Inc. provides IT solutions in the areas of AI and entertainment software fields in Japan. The company is involved in HD business; development of AI and SaaS-related services; provision of design planning and programming planning, hardware and software development, progress management, video production services. It also engages in the renewable energy business; decarbonization and SDGs projects; and sports DX business. In addition, the company develops a prototype of an autonomous driving app, AI learning robot for children, automotive remote control system, live streaming app, projection mapping videos, 3D signage/motion authentication system, entertainment software, and game applications. The company was formerly known as BEL AIR Co., Ltd. and changed its name to TECHNOLOGIES, Inc. in May 2022. TECHNOLOGIES, Inc. was founded in 2014 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan."
